<table border="1" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1"><tbody><tr><td></td><td style="text-align: center;"><strong>List-I</strong></td><td></td><td style="text-align: center;"><strong>List-II</strong></td></tr><tr><td>A.</td><td>ETS Complex I</td><td>I.</td><td>NADH Dehydrogenase</td></tr><tr><td>B.</td><td>ETS Complex II</td><td>II.</td><td>Cytochrome bC<sub>1</sub></td></tr><tr><td>C.</td><td>ETS Complex III</td><td>III.</td><td>Cytochrome C oxidase</td></tr><tr><td>D.</td><td>ETS Complex IV</td><td>IV.</td><td>Succinate Dehydrogenase</td></tr></tbody></table>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:&nbsp;
